      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 628,
        "height": 904,
        "content": "## 🚀 Trigger & Data Sources\nKicks off the run manually, pulls the list of desired custom fields from your Google Sheet, and fetches GHL's current business fields for reference before anything gets created."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "c439a720-2fe9-448b-a29e-9eefcf170bb8",
      "name": "Section - Loop & Duplicate Check",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        400,
        -160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 800,
        "height": 636,
        "content": "## 🔁 Loop & Duplicate Check\nSteps through each sheet row one at a time and only lets fields marked `UNDONE` continue on to creation — anything already done stays put and the loop moves on."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "3e417aca-3a46-4771-b1ee-639278ca5cb6",
      "name": "Section - Create & Log Result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1248,
        -320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 780,
        "height": 856,
        "content": "## ✅ Create & Log Result\nSends the new field to GHL's API, then writes the outcome straight back to the sheet — the new field ID and a `Done` status on success, or an `Error` flag if the call fails."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
